Rods downstream patch 0002 (FEAT-090, engine release rods-0.5.1-k21-r5). Applies on top of valhalla e2f017b16080 +
0001-meili-stateful-terminal-segment.patch. Bounds meili's top-k (alternates) map-matching search:
- meili.default.alternates_cost_band: stop looking for alternates once the next path costs more than the best path plus
  the band (paths come cheapest-first, so nothing inside the band can follow). Negative (default) = off.
- meili.default.alternates_max_iterations: after that many search rounds refuse the request with the new error 447
  "Map Match alternates search exceeded its bound" (trace_attributes passes 447 through; every other failure is still
  444). 0 (default) = unbounded.
- every round polls the caller's interrupt (the server's request timeout now stops the search). Not config-gated.
A request asking for no alternates runs exactly one round and is unaffected by all three.

